  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 805.18 Decomposition Gas Control and Migration Monitoring System Design Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 805.18 Decomposition Gas Control and Migration Monitoring System Design Standards.\n\n(a) Decomposition gas control and migration monitoring systems shall be required at landfills with the potential to generate decomposition gasses.\n\n(b) Decomposition gas control and migration monitoring systems shall be designed to meet the decomposition gas control requirements in Env-Sw 806.07 and to control to the greatest extent practicable malodorous gas emissions.\n\nSource. #14156, eff 12-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw800.html"
